<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/10/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "All offences which before the commencement of this Act had been tried by any of the native courts aforesaid shall, except where it has been otherwise judicially declared, be deemed to have been validly tried as if jurisdiction in respect thereof had been conferred on those courts by federal law."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/10/eng@> .
